{
  "version": "0.20.0-alpha.1",
  "notes": "## 0.20.0-alpha.1 - 2026-07-19\n\n### Features\n\n- Incoming clipboard transfers now keep their receive status across restarts, show combined progress for multi-item entries, and can be canceled from the receiving entry (#1399)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Allow folders copied on Windows to be captured and synced correctly (#1399)\n- Show a clear transfer status for directory sends instead of a misleading percentage that resets for each file (#1408)\n- Show full URLs in a simple wrapping link view instead of truncating them in preview cards (#1411)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.20.0-alpha.1 - 2026-07-19\n\n### Features\n\n- 接收中的剪贴板传输现在会在应用重启后保留接收状态，显示多项内容的汇总进度，并支持从接收条目中取消 (#1399)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复 Windows 上复制的文件夹无法被正确捕获和同步的问题 (#1399)\n- 发送文件夹时改为显示明确的传输状态，不再显示随每个文件重置的误导性百分比 (#1408)\n- 链接预览现在以简洁的自动换行链接显示完整网址，不再使用会截断网址的卡片 (#1411)",
